WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:02.262
Step seven shows a guard refusing.

2
00:00:02.262 --> 00:00:06.151
Run the same plan with Apply,
but with Max Removals set to two.

3
00:00:06.151 --> 00:00:09.911
Guard G six refuses: three
removals is more than two;

4
00:00:09.911 --> 00:00:13.225
review them, and run
again with a higher limit.

5
00:00:13.225 --> 00:00:14.400
Nothing is sent.

6
00:00:14.400 --> 00:00:17.438
Step eight applies to the
fake with the default limit.

7
00:00:17.438 --> 00:00:20.390
The same findings and
the same eight changes,

8
00:00:20.390 --> 00:00:24.300
the guards all pass, and eight
requests are sent, none failed.

9
00:00:24.300 --> 00:00:27.688
The fake records the requests
and doesn't change its tenant.

10
00:00:27.688 --> 00:00:31.066
Step nine runs the tests,
three hundred thirty pass,

11
00:00:31.066 --> 00:00:33.290
and you delete the output folder.
